{"id":"forecast-07","section":4,"path":"bank/listening/forecast-07/audio-4.m4a","model":"small","duration":1035.71,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":5.98,"text":"Section 4. You will hear an extract from a talk entitled Health on the Night Shift.","words":[["Section",0.0,0.48],["4.",0.48,0.98],["You",1.76,1.96],["will",1.96,2.12],["hear",2.12,2.3],["an",2.3,2.48],["extract",2.48,2.78],["from",2.78,3.22],["a",3.22,3.38],["talk",3.38,3.58],["entitled",3.58,4.16],["Health",4.16,4.92],["on",4.92,5.28],["the",5.28,5.4],["Night",5.4,5.62],["Shift.",5.62,5.98]]},{"start":7.08,"end":13.84,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 31 to 40 on pages 8 and 9.","words":[["First,",7.08,7.8],["you",8.0,8.02],["have",8.02,8.16],["some",8.16,8.36],["time",8.36,8.66],["to",8.66,8.86],["look",8.86,8.98],["at",8.98,9.14],["questions",9.14,9.54],["31",9.54,10.62],["to",10.62,10.98],["40",10.98,11.42],["on",11.42,12.16],["pages",12.16,12.58],["8",12.58,13.0],["and",13.0,13.48],["9.",13.48,13.84]]},{"start":54.37,"end":58.27,"text":"Now, listen carefully and answer questions 31 to 40.","words":[["Now,",54.37,54.67],["listen",54.71,54.97],["carefully",54.97,55.41],["and",55.41,55.89],["answer",55.89,56.15],["questions",56.15,56.59],["31",56.59,57.47],["to",57.47,57.87],["40.",57.87,58.27]]},{"start":61.8,"end":68.64,"text":"Good afternoon, everybody. In this session, I want to continue looking at health issues relating to the workplace.","words":[["Good",61.8,62.26],["afternoon,",62.26,62.68],["everybody.",62.76,63.08],["In",63.9,64.26],["this",64.26,64.44],["session,",64.44,64.88],["I",64.88,65.16],["want",65.16,65.34],["to",65.34,65.5],["continue",65.5,65.88],["looking",65.88,66.18],["at",66.18,66.42],["health",66.42,66.7],["issues",66.7,67.18],["relating",67.18,67.62],["to",67.62,68.02],["the",68.02,68.14],["workplace.",68.14,68.64]]},{"start":68.64,"end":75.9,"text":"And I'd like to focus today on night shift workers and the health problems that are associated with their working hours.","words":[["And",68.64,69.74],["I'd",69.74,69.9],["like",69.9,70.02],["to",70.02,70.18],["focus",70.18,70.46],["today",70.46,70.84],["on",70.84,71.12],["night",71.12,71.44],["shift",71.44,71.74],["workers",71.74,72.12],["and",72.12,72.88],["the",72.88,73.02],["health",73.02,73.26],["problems",73.26,73.76],["that",73.76,74.06],["are",74.06,74.2],["associated",74.2,74.76],["with",74.76,75.12],["their",75.12,75.3],["working",75.3,75.58],["hours.",75.58,75.9]]},{"start":76.86,"end":83.88,"text":"I'm sure you're all aware that there has been a huge increase in the number of workers doing regular night shifts in recent years,","words":[["I'm",76.86,77.46],["sure",77.46,77.66],["you're",77.66,77.88],["all",77.88,78.14],["aware",78.14,78.46],["that",78.46,78.72],["there",78.72,78.9],["has",78.9,79.04],["been",79.04,79.2],["a",79.2,79.3],["huge",79.3,79.7],["increase",79.7,80.18],["in",80.18,80.44],["the",80.44,80.54],["number",80.54,80.82],["of",80.82,81.0],["workers",81.0,81.36],["doing",81.36,81.7],["regular",81.7,82.28],["night",82.28,82.62],["shifts",82.62,82.94],["in",82.94,83.18],["recent",83.18,83.44],["years,",83.44,83.88]]},{"start":84.18,"end":90.38,"text":"mainly because of the number of shops and services now open 24 hours, seven days a week.","words":[["mainly",84.18,84.84],["because",84.84,85.22],["of",85.22,85.54],["the",85.54,85.62],["number",85.62,85.9],["of",85.9,86.06],["shops",86.06,86.46],["and",86.46,86.74],["services",86.74,87.26],["now",87.26,87.66],["open",87.66,88.06],["24",88.06,88.5],["hours,",88.5,89.04],["seven",89.42,89.74],["days",89.74,89.96],["a",89.96,90.18],["week.",90.18,90.38]]},{"start":90.82,"end":96.36,"text":"And we need to look more closely at the consequences of changing work and sleep patterns like this.","words":[["And",90.82,91.28],["we",91.28,91.4],["need",91.4,91.54],["to",91.54,91.68],["look",91.68,91.84],["more",91.84,92.04],["closely",92.04,92.66],["at",92.66,92.92],["the",92.92,93.02],["consequences",93.02,93.6],["of",93.6,94.08],["changing",94.08,94.54],["work",94.54,94.96],["and",94.96,95.18],["sleep",95.18,95.42],["patterns",95.42,95.82],["like",95.82,96.1],["this.",96.1,96.36]]},{"start":97.04,"end":99.18,"text":"So, that's what I'd like us to do today.","words":[["So,",97.04,97.6],["that's",97.64,97.94],["what",97.94,98.06],["I'd",98.06,98.26],["like",98.26,98.38],["us",98.38,98.6],["to",98.6,98.72],["do",98.72,98.86],["today.",98.86,99.18]]},{"start":100.2,"end":106.32,"text":"Now, research that has been carried out in both the US and Britain on night-working suggests","words":[["Now,",100.2,100.62],["research",100.82,101.16],["that",101.16,101.56],["has",101.56,101.7],["been",101.7,101.86],["carried",101.86,102.18],["out",102.18,102.4],["in",102.4,102.7],["both",102.7,103.0],["the",103.0,103.26],["US",103.26,103.58],["and",103.58,103.9],["Britain",103.9,104.24],["on",104.24,104.94],["night",104.94,105.18],["-working",105.18,105.52],["suggests",105.52,106.32]]},{"start":106.32,"end":111.42,"text":"that it leads to a lot of health problems for the workers, and they point to three main","words":[["that",106.32,106.96],["it",106.96,107.08],["leads",107.08,107.32],["to",107.32,107.54],["a",107.54,107.68],["lot",107.68,107.98],["of",107.98,108.1],["health",108.1,108.32],["problems",108.32,108.84],["for",108.84,109.06],["the",109.06,109.16],["workers,",109.16,109.46],["and",109.84,110.26],["they",110.26,110.38],["point",110.38,110.62],["to",110.62,110.84],["three",110.84,111.12],["main",111.12,111.42]]},{"start":111.42,"end":112.28,"text":"reasons for this.","words":[["reasons",111.42,111.86],["for",111.86,112.12],["this.",112.12,112.28]]},{"start":113.22,"end":119.16,"text":"The first one is what they call the internal clock, and this is a basic sort of program","words":[["The",113.22,113.5],["first",113.5,113.72],["one",113.72,114.0],["is",114.0,114.28],["what",114.28,114.44],["they",114.44,114.62],["call",114.62,114.96],["the",114.96,115.22],["internal",115.22,115.78],["clock,",115.78,116.28],["and",116.88,117.32],["this",117.32,117.5],["is",117.5,117.64],["a",117.64,117.74],["basic",117.74,118.12],["sort",118.12,118.44],["of",118.44,118.62],["program",118.62,119.16]]},{"start":119.16,"end":120.1,"text":"in our brains.","words":[["in",119.16,119.5],["our",119.5,119.64],["brains.",119.64,120.1]]},{"start":120.66,"end":126.12,"text":"This tells us that at certain times we should feel hungry, at other times we should be","words":[["This",120.66,121.06],["tells",121.06,121.42],["us",121.42,121.68],["that",121.68,121.92],["at",121.92,122.04],["certain",122.04,122.38],["times",122.38,122.92],["we",122.92,123.18],["should",123.18,123.34],["feel",123.34,123.56],["hungry,",123.56,123.98],["at",124.34,124.72],["other",124.72,124.86],["times",124.86,125.4],["we",125.4,125.7],["should",125.7,125.96],["be",125.96,126.12]]},{"start":126.12,"end":132.86,"text":"awake. At other times, we should be asleep and so on. And it seems to be generally accepted by all","words":[["awake.",126.12,126.42],["At",126.88,127.06],["other",127.06,127.22],["times,",127.22,127.68],["we",127.94,128.12],["should",128.12,128.28],["be",128.28,128.44],["asleep",128.44,128.86],["and",128.86,129.08],["so",129.08,129.32],["on.",129.32,129.54],["And",130.22,130.38],["it",130.38,130.5],["seems",130.5,130.72],["to",130.72,130.86],["be",130.86,131.0],["generally",131.0,131.48],["accepted",131.48,132.14],["by",132.14,132.54],["all",132.54,132.86]]},{"start":132.86,"end":139.74,"text":"the experts in the field that this clock is linked to not just our behavioral habits,","words":[["the",132.86,133.0],["experts",133.0,133.42],["in",133.42,133.64],["the",133.64,133.74],["field",133.74,134.06],["that",134.06,134.24],["this",134.24,134.44],["clock",134.44,134.86],["is",134.86,135.68],["linked",135.68,136.0],["to",136.0,136.46],["not",136.46,137.8],["just",137.8,138.1],["our",138.1,138.44],["behavioral",138.44,139.06],["habits,",139.06,139.74]]},{"start":140.24,"end":146.18,"text":"but to cycles of light and dark. And that means that we're programmed to be awake when it's","words":[["but",140.24,140.66],["to",140.66,140.86],["cycles",140.86,141.2],["of",141.2,141.86],["light",141.86,142.12],["and",142.12,142.34],["dark.",142.34,142.66],["And",142.8,142.88],["that",142.88,143.04],["means",143.04,143.3],["that",143.3,144.02],["we're",144.02,144.22],["programmed",144.22,144.62],["to",144.62,144.88],["be",144.88,145.04],["awake",145.04,145.54],["when",145.54,145.98],["it's",145.98,146.18]]},{"start":146.18,"end":153.04,"text":"light, i.e. during the day, and to sleep when it's dark. The second thing is that","words":[["light,",146.18,146.5],["i",146.94,147.18],[".e.",147.18,147.34],["during",147.34,147.58],["the",147.58,147.76],["day,",147.76,148.1],["and",148.44,148.94],["to",148.94,149.08],["sleep",149.08,149.34],["when",149.34,149.6],["it's",149.6,149.82],["dark.",149.82,150.06],["The",150.68,151.16],["second",151.16,151.48],["thing",151.48,151.92],["is",151.92,152.58],["that",152.58,153.04]]},{"start":153.04,"end":158.1,"text":"And night workers are continually fighting against what is termed a sleep debt.","words":[["And",153.04,153.28],["night",153.28,153.34],["workers",153.34,153.66],["are",153.66,154.2],["continually",154.2,154.96],["fighting",154.96,155.54],["against",155.54,156.08],["what",156.08,156.64],["is",156.64,156.78],["termed",156.78,157.3],["a",157.3,157.4],["sleep",157.4,157.72],["debt.",157.72,158.1]]},{"start":158.88,"end":165.28,"text":"And by this the researchers mean that it's just practically impossible for them to get","words":[["And",158.88,159.38],["by",159.38,159.56],["this",159.56,159.84],["the",159.84,160.04],["researchers",160.04,160.5],["mean",160.5,160.86],["that",160.86,161.2],["it's",161.2,162.7],["just",162.7,162.96],["practically",162.96,163.52],["impossible",163.52,164.1],["for",164.1,164.7],["them",164.7,164.94],["to",164.94,165.14],["get",165.14,165.28]]},{"start":165.28,"end":167.84,"text":"a sufficient amount of sleep in daylight hours.","words":[["a",165.28,165.38],["sufficient",165.38,165.76],["amount",165.76,166.06],["of",166.06,166.24],["sleep",166.24,166.54],["in",166.54,167.1],["daylight",167.1,167.48],["hours.",167.48,167.84]]},{"start":168.42,"end":174.32,"text":"In fact, studies suggest that on average night workers only get between five and six hours","words":[["In",168.42,168.56],["fact,",168.56,168.88],["studies",169.18,169.74],["suggest",169.74,170.22],["that",170.22,170.46],["on",170.46,170.58],["average",170.58,170.98],["night",170.98,171.4],["workers",171.4,171.76],["only",171.76,172.24],["get",172.24,172.5],["between",172.5,172.84],["five",172.84,173.54],["and",173.54,173.8],["six",173.8,174.04],["hours",174.04,174.32]]},{"start":174.32,"end":177.0,"text":"of sleep rather than the eight they need.","words":[["of",174.32,174.5],["sleep",174.5,174.88],["rather",174.88,175.64],["than",175.64,175.9],["the",175.9,176.02],["eight",176.02,176.36],["they",176.36,176.6],["need.",176.6,177.0]]},{"start":177.88,"end":182.08,"text":"And the effects of not getting enough sleep can also lead to all sorts of problems","words":[["And",177.88,178.28],["the",178.28,178.36],["effects",178.36,178.66],["of",178.66,178.88],["not",178.88,179.14],["getting",179.14,179.42],["enough",179.42,179.68],["sleep",179.68,180.04],["can",180.04,180.28],["also",180.28,180.58],["lead",180.58,180.82],["to",180.82,181.0],["all",181.0,181.26],["sorts",181.26,181.54],["of",181.54,181.7],["problems",181.7,182.08]]},{"start":182.08,"end":184.16,"text":"problems, and we'll talk about those in a minute.","words":[["problems,",182.08,182.2],["and",182.5,182.82],["we'll",182.82,183.1],["talk",183.1,183.34],["about",183.34,183.5],["those",183.5,183.74],["in",183.74,183.88],["a",183.88,183.98],["minute.",183.98,184.16]]},{"start":185.1,"end":190.66,"text":"The third cause of these problems is the unsocial hours that night workers have to keep.","words":[["The",185.1,185.56],["third",185.56,185.82],["cause",185.82,186.14],["of",186.14,186.38],["these",186.38,186.58],["problems",186.58,187.12],["is",187.12,187.8],["the",187.8,187.98],["unsocial",187.98,188.62],["hours",188.62,189.12],["that",189.12,189.38],["night",189.38,189.58],["workers",189.58,189.9],["have",189.9,190.2],["to",190.2,190.34],["keep.",190.34,190.66]]},{"start":191.3,"end":196.3,"text":"The fact that they are working when their families, their friends are sleeping, and","words":[["The",191.3,191.52],["fact",191.52,191.8],["that",191.8,192.0],["they",192.0,192.14],["are",192.14,192.22],["working",192.22,192.58],["when",192.58,192.86],["their",192.86,193.08],["families,",193.08,193.72],["their",194.08,194.18],["friends",194.18,194.76],["are",194.76,195.06],["sleeping,",195.06,195.52],["and",196.04,196.3]]},{"start":196.3,"end":203.08,"text":"vice versa, and that kind of dislocation from their social group can be very damaging.","words":[["vice",196.3,196.52],["versa,",196.52,196.96],["and",197.46,197.92],["that",197.92,199.28],["kind",199.28,199.58],["of",199.58,199.74],["dislocation",199.74,200.6],["from",200.6,201.22],["their",201.22,201.4],["social",201.4,201.76],["group",201.76,202.14],["can",202.14,202.3],["be",202.3,202.42],["very",202.42,202.64],["damaging.",202.64,203.08]]},{"start":208.62,"end":211.9,"text":"Okay, so let's take a closer look at some of these effects.","words":[["Okay,",208.62,208.88],["so",209.32,209.7],["let's",209.7,210.12],["take",210.12,210.28],["a",210.28,210.42],["closer",210.42,210.7],["look",210.7,210.94],["at",210.94,211.1],["some",211.1,211.26],["of",211.26,211.38],["these",211.38,211.5],["effects.",211.5,211.9]]},{"start":211.9,"end":218.22,"text":"effects. And if we have a look at the physical effects first, we can see that studies on","words":[["effects.",211.9,212.42],["And",212.44,213.04],["if",213.04,213.54],["we",213.54,214.1],["have",214.1,214.36],["a",214.36,214.46],["look",214.46,214.6],["at",214.6,214.74],["the",214.74,214.86],["physical",214.86,215.32],["effects",215.32,215.78],["first,",215.78,216.1],["we",216.7,217.06],["can",217.06,217.26],["see",217.26,217.44],["that",217.44,217.62],["studies",217.62,217.96],["on",217.96,218.22]]},{"start":218.22,"end":223.16,"text":"long-term shift workers found that they were much more likely to get heart problems than","words":[["long",218.22,218.52],["-term",218.52,218.76],["shift",218.76,219.04],["workers",219.04,219.46],["found",219.46,220.22],["that",220.22,220.42],["they",220.42,220.6],["were",220.6,220.74],["much",220.74,221.06],["more",221.06,221.24],["likely",221.24,221.56],["to",221.56,221.78],["get",221.78,221.92],["heart",221.92,222.32],["problems",222.32,222.84],["than",222.84,223.16]]},{"start":223.16,"end":229.28,"text":"day workers. In addition, there seems to be a very high incidence of stomach problems,","words":[["day",223.16,223.5],["workers.",223.5,223.82],["In",224.58,224.7],["addition,",224.7,225.14],["there",225.78,226.0],["seems",226.0,226.28],["to",226.28,226.46],["be",226.46,226.7],["a",226.7,226.94],["very",226.94,227.22],["high",227.22,227.56],["incidence",227.56,227.9],["of",227.9,228.3],["stomach",228.3,228.68],["problems,",228.68,229.28]]},{"start":229.52,"end":235.12,"text":"for example, ulcers among night shift workers. And although this may be partly due to","words":[["for",229.52,229.7],["example,",229.7,230.12],["ulcers",230.56,231.0],["among",231.0,231.44],["night",231.44,231.78],["shift",231.78,232.0],["workers.",232.0,232.44],["And",232.96,233.26],["although",233.26,233.68],["this",233.68,234.18],["may",234.18,234.34],["be",234.34,234.46],["partly",234.46,234.7],["due",234.7,234.98],["to",234.98,235.12]]},{"start":235.12,"end":242.12,"text":"the wrong sort of diet, you know, snacking on fast food, it can't be just explained by","words":[["the",235.12,235.24],["wrong",235.24,235.52],["sort",235.52,235.76],["of",235.76,235.9],["diet,",235.9,236.26],["you",236.64,236.72],["know,",236.72,236.92],["snacking",237.18,237.68],["on",237.68,237.82],["fast",237.82,238.18],["food,",238.18,238.54],["it",239.18,240.04],["can't",240.04,240.44],["be",240.44,240.68],["just",240.68,241.2],["explained",241.2,241.82],["by",241.82,242.12]]},{"start":242.12,"end":242.76,"text":"eating habits.","words":[["eating",242.12,242.38],["habits.",242.38,242.76]]},{"start":243.76,"end":249.42,"text":"And finally, there is evidence to suggest that night shift workers also get ill more","words":[["And",243.76,243.9],["finally,",243.9,244.28],["there",244.76,245.12],["is",245.12,245.3],["evidence",245.3,245.6],["to",245.6,245.88],["suggest",245.88,246.26],["that",246.26,246.48],["night",246.48,246.88],["shift",246.88,247.06],["workers",247.06,247.54],["also",247.54,248.4],["get",248.4,248.7],["ill",248.7,249.14],["more",249.14,249.42]]},{"start":249.42,"end":252.92,"text":"frequently with minor problems like colds and infections.","words":[["frequently",249.42,249.94],["with",249.94,250.38],["minor",250.38,250.86],["problems",250.86,251.36],["like",251.36,251.74],["colds",251.74,252.4],["and",252.4,252.48],["infections.",252.48,252.92]]},{"start":253.84,"end":259.46,"text":"The frequency of these illnesses is much higher than among day workers, and this","words":[["The",253.84,254.1],["frequency",254.1,254.54],["of",254.54,255.04],["these",255.04,255.32],["illnesses",255.32,255.86],["is",255.86,256.82],["much",256.82,257.06],["higher",257.06,257.42],["than",257.42,257.62],["among",257.62,257.9],["day",257.9,258.18],["workers,",258.18,258.52],["and",258.88,259.26],["this",259.26,259.46]]},{"start":259.46,"end":263.46,"text":"indicates that night working can damage immunity to illness.","words":[["indicates",259.46,259.88],["that",259.88,260.6],["night",260.6,261.0],["working",261.0,261.4],["can",261.4,261.74],["damage",261.74,262.2],["immunity",262.2,262.84],["to",262.84,263.14],["illness.",263.14,263.46]]},{"start":263.46,"end":267.82,"text":"And of course, this leads to a lot of absence from work, too.","words":[["And",263.46,264.4],["of",264.4,264.58],["course,",264.58,264.9],["this",265.28,265.56],["leads",265.56,265.92],["to",265.92,266.16],["a",266.16,266.3],["lot",266.3,266.44],["of",266.44,266.56],["absence",266.56,267.0],["from",267.0,267.32],["work,",267.32,267.58],["too.",267.64,267.82]]},{"start":268.96,"end":274.96,"text":"However, although the physical impact of working nights can be severe, perhaps the real problems","words":[["However,",268.96,269.28],["although",269.88,270.12],["the",270.12,270.28],["physical",270.28,270.6],["impact",270.6,271.1],["of",271.1,271.28],["working",271.28,271.5],["nights",271.5,271.82],["can",271.82,272.08],["be",272.08,272.22],["severe,",272.22,272.76],["perhaps",273.38,273.88],["the",273.88,274.1],["real",274.1,274.42],["problems",274.42,274.96]]},{"start":274.96,"end":276.62,"text":"are psychological ones.","words":[["are",274.96,275.38],["psychological",275.38,276.12],["ones.",276.12,276.62]]},{"start":277.62,"end":280.1,"text":"And the most common problem is depression.","words":[["And",277.62,278.06],["the",278.06,278.2],["most",278.2,278.34],["common",278.34,278.68],["problem",278.68,279.14],["is",279.14,279.7],["depression.",279.7,280.1]]},{"start":280.92,"end":286.36,"text":"This seems to be the inevitable result of the constant feeling of tiredness and a lack","words":[["This",280.92,281.18],["seems",281.18,281.54],["to",281.54,281.74],["be",281.74,281.86],["the",281.86,282.0],["inevitable",282.0,282.38],["result",282.38,282.86],["of",282.86,283.46],["the",283.46,283.6],["constant",283.6,284.08],["feeling",284.08,284.56],["of",284.56,284.78],["tiredness",284.78,285.52],["and",285.52,286.06],["a",286.06,286.2],["lack",286.2,286.36]]},{"start":286.36,"end":289.42,"text":"of energy that night workers universally complain of.","words":[["of",286.36,286.48],["energy",286.48,286.86],["that",286.86,287.12],["night",287.12,287.3],["workers",287.3,287.64],["universally",287.64,288.72],["complain",288.72,289.1],["of.",289.1,289.42]]},{"start":290.3,"end":295.76,"text":"Secondly, there is a lot of evidence from accident statistics to suggest that mental","words":[["Secondly,",290.3,290.98],["there",291.44,291.72],["is",291.72,291.86],["a",291.86,291.96],["lot",291.96,292.12],["of",292.12,292.24],["evidence",292.24,292.56],["from",292.56,292.88],["accident",292.88,293.5],["statistics",293.5,294.2],["to",294.2,294.54],["suggest",294.54,294.94],["that",294.94,295.26],["mental",295.26,295.76]]},{"start":295.76,"end":302.46,"text":"abilities are badly affected, and that means, for example, decision-making ability and planning","words":[["abilities",295.76,296.26],["are",296.26,297.0],["badly",297.0,297.42],["affected,",297.42,297.88],["and",298.06,298.22],["that",298.22,298.48],["means,",298.48,298.78],["for",298.9,299.02],["example,",299.02,299.46],["decision",300.14,300.74],["-making",300.74,301.04],["ability",301.04,301.56],["and",301.56,302.04],["planning",302.04,302.46]]},{"start":302.46,"end":302.98,"text":"ability.","words":[["ability.",302.46,302.98]]},{"start":303.82,"end":305.7,"text":"And these are what control our performance.","words":[["And",303.82,304.06],["these",304.06,304.3],["are",304.3,304.44],["what",304.44,304.58],["control",304.58,304.98],["our",304.98,305.16],["performance.",305.16,305.7]]},{"start":306.46,"end":311.92,"text":"For example, we can see that the highest number of errors on the roads occur between","words":[["For",306.46,306.64],["example,",306.64,307.0],["we",307.16,307.3],["can",307.3,307.48],["see",307.48,307.84],["that",307.84,308.12],["the",308.12,308.32],["highest",308.32,308.68],["number",308.68,309.1],["of",309.1,309.28],["errors",309.28,309.66],["on",309.66,309.94],["the",309.94,310.04],["roads",310.04,310.56],["occur",310.56,311.48],["between",311.48,311.92]]},{"start":311.92,"end":317.6,"text":"between 3 a.m. and 5 a.m., the point in our internal clock when we feel most sleepy.","words":[["between",311.92,312.06],["3",312.06,312.32],["a",312.32,312.5],[".m.",312.5,312.7],["and",312.7,312.8],["5",312.8,313.08],["a",313.08,313.34],[".m.,",313.34,313.88],["the",313.88,314.18],["point",314.18,314.46],["in",314.46,314.68],["our",314.68,314.94],["internal",314.94,315.48],["clock",315.48,315.92],["when",315.92,316.62],["we",316.62,316.78],["feel",316.78,317.02],["most",317.02,317.24],["sleepy.",317.24,317.6]]},{"start":319.78,"end":326.14,"text":"Okay, finally there are the social problems where night-working impacts on the family","words":[["Okay,",319.78,320.34],["finally",320.34,320.9],["there",320.9,321.66],["are",321.66,321.92],["the",321.92,322.12],["social",322.12,322.46],["problems",322.46,322.98],["where",322.98,323.38],["night",323.38,324.26],["-working",324.26,324.44],["impacts",324.44,325.16],["on",325.16,325.46],["the",325.46,325.6],["family",325.6,326.14]]},{"start":326.14,"end":328.1,"text":"and social life of the employees.","words":[["and",326.14,326.54],["social",326.54,326.94],["life",326.94,327.3],["of",327.3,327.48],["the",327.48,327.6],["employees.",327.6,328.1]]},{"start":328.8,"end":334.1,"text":"The first one is obviously the break-up of family life, and here we can see from the","words":[["The",328.8,329.22],["first",329.22,329.42],["one",329.42,329.66],["is",329.66,329.82],["obviously",329.82,330.26],["the",330.26,330.58],["break",330.58,330.86],["-up",330.86,331.08],["of",331.08,331.24],["family",331.24,331.52],["life,",331.52,331.9],["and",332.08,332.76],["here",332.76,333.0],["we",333.0,333.18],["can",333.18,333.34],["see",333.34,333.62],["from",333.62,333.9],["the",333.9,334.1]]},{"start":334.1,"end":338.82,"text":"divorce statistics that this occurs more frequently in the case of night-workers.","words":[["divorce",334.1,334.5],["statistics",334.5,335.08],["that",335.08,335.86],["this",335.86,336.08],["occurs",336.08,336.42],["more",336.42,336.78],["frequently",336.78,337.24],["in",337.24,337.6],["the",337.6,337.72],["case",337.72,337.98],["of",337.98,338.26],["night",338.26,338.48],["-workers.",338.48,338.82]]},{"start":338.82,"end":346.42,"text":"But there's also the breakdown of other relationships, not just within the family, but among the peer group.","words":[["But",338.82,340.12],["there's",340.12,340.52],["also",340.52,340.76],["the",340.76,340.92],["breakdown",340.92,341.36],["of",341.36,341.84],["other",341.84,342.08],["relationships,",342.08,342.68],["not",343.02,343.48],["just",343.48,343.72],["within",343.72,344.02],["the",344.02,344.2],["family,",344.2,344.64],["but",344.92,345.34],["among",345.34,345.62],["the",345.62,345.82],["peer",345.82,346.02],["group.",346.02,346.42]]},{"start":347.0,"end":354.6,"text":"Night workers tend to lose touch with friends, and these relationships, especially for the long-term night workers,","words":[["Night",347.0,347.46],["workers",347.46,347.72],["tend",347.72,348.44],["to",348.44,348.66],["lose",348.66,348.9],["touch",348.9,349.22],["with",349.22,349.4],["friends,",349.4,349.88],["and",350.28,350.76],["these",350.76,351.0],["relationships,",351.0,351.72],["especially",351.84,352.28],["for",352.28,353.2],["the",353.2,353.38],["long",353.38,353.74],["-term",353.74,353.98],["night",353.98,354.26],["workers,",354.26,354.6]]},{"start":355.14,"end":358.04,"text":"are very difficult to rebuild.","words":[["are",355.14,355.5],["very",355.5,357.1],["difficult",357.1,357.48],["to",357.48,357.72],["rebuild.",357.72,358.04]]},{"start":358.64,"end":362.8,"text":"And so this eventually leads to social isolation for the individual.","words":[["And",358.64,359.04],["so",359.04,359.44],["this",359.44,359.72],["eventually",359.72,360.18],["leads",360.18,360.72],["to",360.72,360.98],["social",360.98,361.34],["isolation",361.34,362.0],["for",362.0,362.24],["the",362.24,362.36],["individual.",362.36,362.8]]},{"start":363.34,"end":366.64,"text":"And of course, that has consequences for the whole community, too.","words":[["And",363.34,363.66],["of",363.66,363.8],["course,",363.8,364.08],["that",364.14,364.36],["has",364.36,364.54],["consequences",364.54,365.08],["for",365.08,365.6],["the",365.6,365.7],["whole",365.7,365.9],["community,",365.9,366.38],["too.",366.48,366.64]]},{"start":367.74,"end":371.66,"text":"So, we can begin to see the real cost of night working.","words":[["So,",367.74,368.38],["we",368.64,368.96],["can",368.96,369.14],["begin",369.14,369.36],["to",369.36,369.56],["see",369.56,369.76],["the",369.76,369.94],["real",369.94,370.28],["cost",370.28,370.78],["of",370.78,371.04],["night",371.04,371.32],["working.",371.32,371.66]]},{"start":372.28,"end":375.4,"text":"What we need to do now is to look at how...","words":[["What",372.28,372.58],["we",372.58,372.76],["need",372.76,372.92],["to",372.92,373.14],["do",373.14,373.28],["now",373.28,373.7],["is",373.7,374.3],["to",374.3,374.52],["look",374.52,374.76],["at",374.76,374.96],["how...",374.96,375.4]]},{"start":378.92,"end":381.06,"text":"That is the end of section 4.","words":[["That",378.92,379.58],["is",379.58,379.78],["the",379.78,379.98],["end",379.98,380.18],["of",380.18,380.34],["section",380.34,380.6],["4.",380.6,381.06]]},{"start":381.96,"end":384.64,"text":"You now have half a minute to check your answers.","words":[["You",381.96,382.16],["now",382.16,382.38],["have",382.38,382.7],["half",382.7,383.08],["a",383.08,383.24],["minute",383.24,383.5],["to",383.5,383.88],["check",383.88,384.14],["your",384.14,384.32],["answers.",384.32,384.64]]},{"start":415.02,"end":417.46,"text":"That is the end of the listening test.","words":[["That",415.02,415.62],["is",415.62,415.84],["the",415.84,416.04],["end",416.04,416.42],["of",416.42,416.6],["the",416.6,416.72],["listening",416.72,417.02],["test.",417.02,417.46]]},{"start":418.38,"end":423.72,"text":"You now have 10 minutes to transfer your answers to the listening answer sheet.","words":[["You",418.38,418.88],["now",418.88,419.08],["have",419.08,419.42],["10",419.42,419.82],["minutes",419.82,420.24],["to",420.24,420.86],["transfer",420.86,421.36],["your",421.36,421.6],["answers",421.6,421.98],["to",421.98,422.5],["the",422.5,422.66],["listening",422.66,423.02],["answer",423.02,423.4],["sheet.",423.4,423.72]]},{"start":904.58,"end":906.58,"text":"You have 2 minutes left.","words":[["You",904.58,904.98],["have",904.98,905.3],["2",905.3,905.78],["minutes",905.78,906.16],["left.",906.16,906.58]]},{"start":967.13,"end":968.95,"text":"You have 1 minute left.","words":[["You",967.13,967.37],["have",967.37,967.71],["1",967.71,968.17],["minute",968.17,968.53],["left.",968.53,968.95]]},{"start":968.95,"end":1033.18,"text":"Please stop writing and wait for your question booklet to be collected.","words":[["Please",968.95,969.91],["stop",1029.68,1030.1],["writing",1030.1,1030.48],["and",1030.48,1031.04],["wait",1031.04,1031.24],["for",1031.24,1031.42],["your",1031.42,1031.56],["question",1031.56,1031.96],["booklet",1031.96,1032.34],["to",1032.34,1032.66],["be",1032.66,1032.8],["collected.",1032.8,1033.18]]}]}